# D-GH2-DRBD-REJOIN-WAITS-FOREVER-FOR-PEER-SECONDARY-UNDER-PACEMAKER: the
# boot program after a pair outage with participant 1 promoted by something
# other than MeshXFS (scripts/drbd_rig.sh promoter-test), on the DRBD pair g2
# (test1/test2), each promoter with this tree's program (fix) and with the
# program as it was before the fix (control, PROMOTER_CONTROL).
#
# READING RULES (written before the first lap):
#   control  reach: participant 0 never mounts across the 420 s window, its boot
#            program reports at least one refused attempt, the module reports
#            "the peer is 'Primary'", and nothing names the promoter.  A control
#            lap where participant 1 was not Primary under the promoter, or that
#            mounted, dies with that reason: it reached nothing.
#   fix      pacemaker/become: the boot program stops "refused" within 30 s with
#            a line naming Pacemaker's resource p_drbd / become-primary-on;
#            manual: after the first refused mount (<= 240 s) a line saying
#            something other than MeshXFS promoted the peer.  A fix lap that
#            mounts while the peer is Primary, or never names it: REFUTED.
#   both     with the promoter removed and participant 1 demoted, both nodes
#            mount within 480 s, every fsynced file reads back on both, and a
#            cold chk_mxfs is clean.  No BUG, oops or hung task (the step dies
#            on a mount that never comes; the dmesg streams are kept).
#
# BOUNDS, each from the steps the lap runs (scripts/drbd_rig.sh budgets):
#   up        power-on ~60 s, LUN binds ~30 s, DRBD up and connect ~30 s, the
#             initial sync's SYNC_BUDGET 240 s: 360, plus margin -> 480
#   common    step_mxfs (mkfs and two mounts) ~90, files 10, destroy and boot
#             ~60, prep <= 150, participant 1 Primary <= 150, the removal's
#             recovery <= 480 (SELF_OUTAGE_BUDGET), read-back 60, chk 120,
#             fence reinstall 30: 1150
#   pacemaker + PCMK_APT_BUDGET 240 and the cluster's setup ~60: 1450
#   window    fix 30 (become/pacemaker) or 240 (manual); control 420
480 DRBD_RIG_NO_BASELINE=1 scripts/drbd_rig.sh up
1480 scripts/drbd_rig.sh promoter-test pacemaker
1870 PROMOTER_CONTROL=tests/evidence/drbd_rig/control_mxfs_drbd_fence_self_pre_promoter_fix.py scripts/drbd_rig.sh promoter-test pacemaker
1180 scripts/drbd_rig.sh promoter-test become
1570 PROMOTER_CONTROL=tests/evidence/drbd_rig/control_mxfs_drbd_fence_self_pre_promoter_fix.py scripts/drbd_rig.sh promoter-test become
1390 scripts/drbd_rig.sh promoter-test manual
1570 PROMOTER_CONTROL=tests/evidence/drbd_rig/control_mxfs_drbd_fence_self_pre_promoter_fix.py scripts/drbd_rig.sh promoter-test manual
